        <p class="iw-text">Nov 21 2026  3:30PM [8] [Notification] [CHP]-Problem changed from 1125-Traffic Hazard to 1183-Trfc Collision-Unkn Inj by CHP<br />Nov 21 2026  3:30PM [7] RP ADV TRAFFIC CONTROL WILL BE NEEDED <br />Nov 21 2026  3:30PM [6] ***RP HEARD ONLY ****<br />Nov 21 2026  3:29PM [2] RP ADV CAUSING TRAFFIC TO BUILD UP <br />Nov 21 2026  3:29PM [1] MULTI VEH TC - NEG DESCRIP OF VEHS - NEG EXACT AMOUNT OF VEHS <br /></p>
        
