    <div class="iw-body">
        <h2 class="iw-title">CFIRE-Car Fire</h2>
        
        <p class="iw-text">Nov 21 2026  2:31AM <br> I80 W / PENRYN RD OFR</p>
        <p class="iw-text">Nov 21 2026  4:24AM [72] 45-265 VIA LL // NEG HAZMAT SPILL SITUATION // JUST BURNED STYROFOAM MATERIALS  // WILL HAVE CT CLEAN IT UP AND DETERMINE IF CT CAN MOVE THE TRLR OR IF IS SUFFICIENTLY CLEAN FOR ALL AMERICAN TO TAKE THE TK [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  3:40AM [65] [Notification] [CHP]-CT ETA APPROX 30  MINS [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  3:29AM [59] CT SUP STILL AWAITINBG ETA // GETTING CREW TOGETHER [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  3:28AM [56] 45-265 ADV WILL LIKELY NEED A LOWBOY TO TOW // COMPANY MAY NEED TO RESPOND TO DETERMINE NEEDED EQUIPMENT [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  3:27AM [55] 1039 45-265 CPZ WILL ASCERTAIN SITUATION AND ADV [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  3:22AM [52] CT SUP WILL CALL BACK WITH ETA  [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  3:11AM [50] 45-S5 START CT FOR EXTENDED CLOSURE #3 LANE AND PENRYN OFR // MAY NEED ASSISTENCE CLEANING UP [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  3:05AM [49] ALL AMERICAN CPZ HD  FOR BURNED TRLR AND TRLR STILL ON FIRE [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  3:01AM [46] [Rotation Request Comment] *** 1039 ALL AMERICAN TOWING (XXX) XXX-XXXX ***<br />Nov 21 2026  2:57AM [41] C45-281 #3 AND PENRYN OFR CLOSED [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  2:57AM [40] C45-265 TK DETATCHED FROM TRLR / TRLR FULLY ENGULFED / 53 FT / WAS LOADED WITH STYROFOAM AND CONSUMABLES / START 1185 HD / TRLR STILL BURNING [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  2:49AM [39] C45-281 FIRE BLOCING THE #3 [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  2:44AM [37] PLACER FIRE 97 // ADV TRLR FULLY ENGULFED / CAB IS DISCONNECTED FROM TRLR // 80 W / AT PENRYN OFR [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  2:43AM [36] LL PLACER FIRE [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  2:43AM [34] [Appended, 02:43:28] [1] XFER FIRE <br />Nov 21 2026  2:42AM [32] RP HAS VIS OF FIRE GOING 97 [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  2:42AM [29] [Appended, 02:42:26] [1] XFER FIRE <br />Nov 21 2026  2:41AM [28] [Notification] [CHP]-Problem changed from 1125-Traffic Hazard to CFIRE-Car Fire by CHP [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  2:37AM [21] XFER PLACER FIRE ENRT  [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  2:37AM [22] [Appended, 02:37:45] [1] XFER FIRE <br />Nov 21 2026  2:35AM [13] BLU SEMI TK TO RHS  [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  2:35AM [12] RR TIRES ON FIRE  [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  2:35AM [9] [Notification] [CHP]-[4] RP ADV THE VEH JUST PULLED OVER ON RHS JEO PENRYN RD<br />Nov 21 2026  2:35AM [18] [Appended, 02:37:32] [2] WHEELS ON FIRE <br />Nov 21 2026  2:35AM [17] [Appended, 02:37:32] [1] SEMI TK PULLED TO RHS <br />Nov 21 2026  2:33AM [5] XFER FIRE <br />Nov 21 2026  2:33AM [4] RP ADV THE VEH JUST PULLED OVER ON RHS JEO PENRYN RD <br />Nov 21 2026  2:32AM [3] VEH IS MOVING <br />Nov 21 2026  2:32AM [2] RR TIRE ON FIRE /SEES FLAMES<br />Nov 21 2026  2:32AM [1] BLUE SEMI TK <br /></p>
        
        <p class="iw-attribution">
            Information courtesy of <strong>CHP</strong>
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="iw-footer">
