        <p class="iw-text">Nov 21 2026  1:28AM [68] 68-10 NEG 180S JUST YET / VEH STILL 97 W / PGandE [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  1:28AM [67] [Notification] [CHP]-Problem changed from 1179-Trfc Collision-1141 Enrt to 1181-Trfc Collision-Minor Inj by CHP [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026  1:28AM [66] B68-010 PTY BOOKED FOR 23152AB / SOLO VEH 1181 [Shared]<br />Nov 21 2026 12:04AM [60] LE 68-30 REQ  PGE CB WHEN VEH CAN BE TOWED  [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 11:51PM [58] 68-30 CONES PLACED AROUND VEH AT TC SCENE FOR FURTHER CALLS  [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 11:10PM [52] B68-030 ****  FOR INFO INCASE OF CALLS **** VEH ON CANAL JWO SR43 JNO ELDER AVE --- SIL CHEV CRZ W MAJ FE DMG AIRBAGS DEPLOYED LIGHTS TO VEH ARE ON  [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 11:10PM [51] B68-030  1022 1185 --- PGE  ADVD UNABLE TO RECOVER VEH AS OF NOW UNK ETA FOR WHEN CAN DEENERGIZE THE LINES ---- PGE  WILL CB AND ADV WHEN CHP CAN  COMEBACK TO DO 180/ HAVBE VEH TAKEN OUT [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:50PM [48] [Rotation Request Comment] *****1039 PRIME ROAD SOLUTIONS (XXX) XXX-XXXX***** [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:48PM [46] 68-30 REQ 1185 WILL POSS NEED FB FOR SD W MAJ FE DMG  [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:48PM [45] PGE - ETA 15 MIN  [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:47PM [43] [Notification] [CHP]-KCSO ADV PGandE ETA 15 MINS [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:45PM [41] 1039 PGE ---- WILL CB W ETA AND REF  [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:44PM [40] KCSO CONTACTED PGE -- WILL CB and ADV ETA [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:40PM [37] 68-30 JUST WANT TO MAKE SURE LINES ARE DEENERGIZED PRIOR TO STARTING 1185 [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:35PM [33] B68-030 ETA FRM PGE OR EDISON TO SHUT OFF POWER -- STILL ACTIVE LINES  [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:23PM [31] AND FIRE  [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:23PM [30] 1039 EMS  [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:22PM [29] B68-030 1022 FIRE AND 1141 [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:21PM [27] B68-030 ADV PGE OR EDISON COMPLETELY SHEERED POLE ON WEST SHOULDER AMPLE ROOM TO WORK ON SHOULDER BUT MAY NEED OWN 1184 [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:21PM [26] B68-030 SOLO VEH 1182 FOR NOW  [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:14PM [19] PER KCSO -- SOLO VEH VS POWER POLE // POSS SPARKING -- KCSO ADVSD EMS / FIRE [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:14PM [18] 1039 FIRE  [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:13PM [17] LL FIRE  [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:13PM [16] 1039 EMS [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:13PM [12] MALE PREV 23103 -- SWERVING -- OFF RDWY [Shared]<br />Nov 20 2026 10:12PM [6] POLE ON RHS<br />Nov 20 2026 10:11PM [4] WIRES HOLDING TOP PART OF POLE<br />Nov 20 2026 10:11PM [3] POLE SHEARED <br />Nov 20 2026 10:11PM [7] [Appended, 22:12:46] [1] IPHONE TC NOTIF <br />Nov 20 2026 10:11PM [1] VEH VS POLE<br /></p>
        
